+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing questions are classified by `classifyBillingQuestion`. A message containing the exact lowercase substring `refund` is classified as `refund-review`; every other message is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+This classifier establishes routing only. It does not establish refund eligibility, invoice correctness, payment state, amounts, timing, or resolution.

